<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 8/11.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 8/11.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Friday set</p>
<p>the following currency fixings for August 11. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   07.08.97	  06.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.3628	    6.3938</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1360	    2.1260</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.2078	    4.1864</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.3740	    3.3713</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.4967	    0.4945</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7132	    0.7133</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2673	    0.2657</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.7653	    6.7278</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6882	    0.6886</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1400	    1.1396</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
